# scripts/dev/browser/profile — agent's persistent Chromium profile
#
# Only the directory layout and this README are tracked. All Chromium runtime
# data is excluded so a fresh clone boots into a clean profile; the running
# browser instance regenerates everything below on first launch.
#
# Start it with:
#   scripts/dev/persistent-browser.sh start agent
# Override with:
#   AN_BROWSER_PROFILE=/some/other/profile

# Default profile directory: every sub-path except the explicit allow-list.
Default/*
!Default/.gitkeep

# Explicitly exclude every kind of runtime data Chromium writes under Default/.
Default/Cookies
Default/Cookies-journal
Default/History
Default/History-journal
Default/History Provider Root/
Default/Local Storage/**
Default/Session Storage/**
Default/IndexedDB/**
Default/Cache/**
